# emacs-plus@31 links these at runtime but declares them build-time only, so
# `brew autoremove` strips them and the `emacs` binary then fails to launch
# ("Library not loaded: .../libjpeg.10.dylib", etc). Keep them explicit
# (installed-on-request) so autoremove leaves them alone. gdk-pixbuf/librsvg
